benchmark.env
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# Saved copies of scripts and configs from before a change. The suffixes vary
# in practice (.bak-ablation, .bak-pr382, .bak-v5refine-20260918,
# .before-config-align-20260915-095558), so the pattern has to allow a suffix
# after the dot -- a bare `*.bak` matches none of them. These files carry
# host-specific paths and user names; they must never reach a public remote.
*.bak
*.bak-*
*.bak2
*.before-*
backups/
